{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫電視（TVB）真人騷《中年好聲音4》今晚（8月23日）晚上7時30分於翡翠台現場直播總決賽《中年好聲音4登峯之戰》，終極7強名單包括：鄭家聲、蔡宓婕、尹景順、吳亦偉、許雲妮、尤淑情及許美琪。</p><p>以下立即為大家帶來即時戰況！</p><p>鄭家聲《海闊天空》90分</p><figure><img alt=\"鄭家聲奪得90分。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168289234105143296587962.jpeg/453J-B5J6qnyzN5I1Z4zOe2tzAyRPTvaS0Z81UtGfNU\"/><figcaption>鄭家聲奪得90分。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>蔡宓婕《美麗之最》91分</p><figure><img alt=\"蔡宓婕奪得91分。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168289287775457280712983.jpeg/Cg5jcZyGS3ewYGKWkpyWRVHi5szdqWAsuq1UmLqtVJg\"/><figcaption>蔡宓婕奪得91分。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>尹景順《百年孤寂》94分</p><figure><img alt=\"尹景順好驚喜。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168291536451014656187064.jpeg/RpbAsNdDrmVSFCXjXUXGtPVEfZ8yTj_JOfWo8jn1qPI\"/><figcaption>尹景順好驚喜。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"尹景順奪得94分。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168291534060130304356498.jpeg/iZ2RgsWZ3ef-2bFQvZ0ebr6UNO8UED_DAjbS3QI20t0\"/><figcaption>尹景順奪得94分。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>吳亦偉《酷愛》92分</p><figure><img alt=\"吳亦偉奪得92分。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168292945489563648238704.jpeg/aRQR9wG2nkd8R-DSjE5OZKWtt7zDhH_goQJJMaECSTE\"/><figcaption>吳亦偉奪得92分。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T12:38:23.700603+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":240,"images":5,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}